  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Add DateTimeOffset overloads for every DateTime API (RelativeTime, BusinessDay, PositionalTime, DateTimeDiff)\n- Add FinalDaysOffset and FinalSpanOffset for offset-aware last-day-of-period queries\n- DateTimeOffset methods preserve the original UTC offset in returned values\n- Namespace has been updated to match .NET best practices\n- Classes have been moved to specific namespaces\n- DateTimeOffset comparisons are offset-aware (compare underlying UTC instants)",
